/Title (Why 6 Legs? 6 legs allows a tripod gait: 3 legs lift and move forward while the other 3 push the body. This is the fastest stable walking pattern. It also means the robot can lose one leg and still walk \(5 legs remain\).)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 747 0 R
/Prev 932 0 R
/Next 1088 0 R
>>
